  abilityDesc: 23 combo massive Water attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP, enormously boosts own critical hit rate), enormous additional damage reduction
    for 3 turns, 100% damage reduction for 3 turns, enormously boosts Atk, Def, Rec
    for 3 turns, enormously boosts Water elemental damage for 3 turns & adds random
    status ailment infliction to attack for 3 turns
